entries[41134] = { ["name"] = "Savage Gladiator's Linked Gauntlets", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nHands Mail\n992 Armor\n+42 Agility\n+87 Stamina\n+ 39 Critical Strike\n+ 39 PvP Resilience\n\nBlue Socket\nSocket Bonus: + 4 Critical Strike\n\nDurability 50 / 50\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 80\nEquip: Improves the range of your Shock and Wind Shear spells by 5 yards.\n\nGladiator's Earthshaker (0/5)\nGladiator's Linked Armor\nGladiator's Linked Gauntlets\nGladiator's Linked Helm\nGladiator's Linked Leggings\nGladiator's Linked Spaulders\n(2) Set : +100 PvP Resilience.\n(2) Set : Increases attack power by 50.\n(4) Set : Increases the chance to trigger your Maelstrom Weapon talent by 20%.\n(4) Set : Increases attack power by 150.\nSell Price:" }
